{"id":133,"root":"كيف","bw":"kyf","tr":"k-y-f","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\">See Supplement <span class=\"lane-pb\" title=\"Lane page 2641\">p.&nbsp;2641</span> </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَيَّفْتُهُ فَتَكَيَّفَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>, used by the Muslim theologians, (K, TA,) verbs derived from <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَيفَ</span>, (TA,) [signifying <em>I specified by the ascription of its quality</em> and <em>it became so specified,</em>] are formed in accordance with analogy, not heard from the Arabs. (K, * TA.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَكَيَّفَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>: see what next precedes. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَيفِيَّةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>Quality as answering to</em> “ <em>how?</em> ”; <em>mode,</em> or <em>manner, of being.</em> </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَيفُوفِيَّةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> for <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَيفِيَّةٌ</span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَيسِيَّةٌ</span>. </div>","pages":[2641,2641],"shownPages":[2641,2641],"chars":991,"entries":5,"shownEntries":5,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"kyf"}